Layerwise Relevance propagation 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "XAI_LRP_Frauenhofer"

\end_inset

 is a method to visualize a image recognition NN's decisions by tracing
 back the most significant factors of decisions thby marking the pixels
 which were most relevant for the decision process.
 This can help with debugging misbehaviour and provides a good insight into
 machine vision, but cannot provide additional trust.
 
